WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.393
Roxy gulped. "Terrell, are you okay?"

2
00:00:04.394 --> 00:00:07.193
Terrell cleared his throat.

3
00:00:07.194 --> 00:00:11.044
"I'm fine, but I'm trapped inside the plant.

4
00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:13.891
We were looking at it when one of the bulbs opened.

5
00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:16.366
It looked like a big mouth.

6
00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:20.454
It ate Jack. Another mouth ate Mara.

7
00:00:20.455 --> 00:00:26.306
Before I could run away, the plant got me."

8
00:00:26.307 --> 00:00:31.288
"Don't worry, Terrell!" Roxy said. "I'll be there right away!"

9
00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:33.832
"Come quickly," Terrell said.

10
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:39.441
"I'm beginning to feel . . ." He yawned.

11
00:00:39.442 --> 00:00:41.851
"Sleepy."

12
00:00:41.852 --> 00:00:45.973
Roxy closed her watch. "Listen, Detective, I need to—"

13
00:00:45.974 --> 00:00:51.526
Smash! A vine shattered the window and grabbed the detective.

14
00:00:51.527 --> 00:00:57.206
"Grr!" Detective Smith tried to wriggle free. "Rocket Girl! Help—"

15
00:00:57.207 --> 00:01:00.516
Gulp! The plant swallowed the detective.

16
00:01:00.517 --> 00:01:02.889
"Ahh!" Roxy screamed.

17
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:05.536
Then another vine reached into the office.

18
00:01:05.537 --> 00:01:07.773
Roxy escaped down the hallway.

19
00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:10.684
She flew out through a window.

20
00:01:10.685 --> 00:01:13.818
"Oh no!" Roxy cried.

21
00:01:13.819 --> 00:01:16.107
Giant plants were everywhere.

22
00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:18.263
Vines whipped back and forth.

23
00:01:18.264 --> 00:01:20.545
Mouths snapped at people.

24
00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:23.520
Below each mouth hung several pods.

25
00:01:23.521 --> 00:01:25.849
Many of the pods wiggled.

26
00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:30.761
"Whoa," Roxy said. "There are people in those pods!"

27
00:01:30.762 --> 00:01:36.931
"The plants are eating people!" an old woman shouted.

28
00:01:36.932 --> 00:01:39.813
"Run for your lives!" a man cried.

29
00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:42.350
"Don't let the plants—" Gulp!

30
00:01:42.351 --> 00:01:44.363
A giant mouth grabbed him.

31
00:01:44.364 --> 00:01:50.221
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted the plant's mouth, and the man jumped out. "Thanks,

32
00:01:50.222 --> 00:01:53.235
Rocket Girl!" He ran down the street. But

33
00:01:53.236 --> 00:01:57.879
then— gulp! Another plant got him.

34
00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.366
"Ugh!" Roxy made a fist.

35
00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:04.356
"How can I stop all these plants from eating people?"

36
00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.595
Roxy heard someone laughing.

37
00:02:06.596 --> 00:02:09.503
A small spaceship floated nearby.

38
00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.452
The top of the spaceship opened.

39
00:02:11.453 --> 00:02:14.989
A woman sat inside, operating the controls.

40
00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:20.038
Roxy's eyes went wide. "Vic Nebula!"

41
00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:24.530
"Hello, Rocket Girl." The villain had an evil smile.

42
00:02:24.531 --> 00:02:27.576
"Are you surprised to see me again?"

43
00:02:27.577 --> 00:02:31.635
"I thought you were gone forever!" Roxy said.

44
00:02:31.636 --> 00:02:33.624
Vic narrowed her eyes.

45
00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:38.804
"I almost was—after you pushed me through that wormhole!"

46
00:02:38.805 --> 00:02:40.680
She gritted her teeth.

47
00:02:40.681 --> 00:02:43.573
"But luckily I landed on a safe planet.

48
00:02:43.574 --> 00:02:48.196
And while I was there, I made some new friends!"

49
00:02:48.197 --> 00:02:51.048
"The plants?" Roxy asked.

50
00:02:51.049 --> 00:02:55.611
Vic nodded. "They store living things in their pods.

51
00:02:55.612 --> 00:02:59.458
Then they feed off their victims' energy."

52
00:02:59.459 --> 00:03:02.944
"Why are you doing this?" Roxy asked.

53
00:03:02.945 --> 00:03:05.970
"I want revenge!" Vic snapped.

54
00:03:05.971 --> 00:03:08.602
"I could have been lost in space forever!

55
00:03:08.603 --> 00:03:12.591
Now my plants will destroy every person in Metro City.

56
00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:15.727
Even you, Rocket Girl!"

57
00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:19.215
Roxy suddenly felt a vine wrap tightly around her.

58
00:03:19.216 --> 00:03:20.714
And then . . .

59
00:03:20.715 --> 00:03:23.181
Gulp!

